00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:37.470
Two years ago, we wiped out Shadow 
Faction, a group of assassins.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:40.270
A couple of months ago, we defeated the 
second invasion from the demon race.

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:43.850
