ran away from the demon world.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:47.680
The spatial crack above Songhai is the 
portal between the human and demon worlds.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:49.310
Demons came to our world through the crack

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:51.270
