My birthday wishes,

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:30.220
did anyone hear them this time?

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:32.220
Keep my words to myself,

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:34.420
and my memories float in the starry sky.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.670
Occasionally I feel depressed.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.510
Occasionally I feel sad.

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:45.470
Who knows the weakness behind my smile?

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:48.090
Mom said that time

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:50.880
once roared like a wind.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.550
Feel your hopes.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.720
Look forward to beautiful.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:02.010
This power comes because 
we have each other around.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.630
Even if the world before me

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:08.260
will change or drift away,

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:13.220
I will be waiting for you 
forever at the end of time.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:19.220
I will be waiting for you 
forever at the end of time.
